### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

### Get Dashboard Overview
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/dashboard/overview
Content-Type: application/json
###

### Get Sales Overview
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/dashboard/sales
Content-Type: application/json
###

### Get Inventory Overview
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/dashboard/inventory
Content-Type: application/json
###

### Get Production Overview
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/dashboard/production
Content-Type: application/json
###

### Get Materials Overview
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/dashboard/materials
Content-Type: application/json
###

### Test without authentication (should return 401)
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/dashboard/overview
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test with wrong permissions (should return 403)
# Use a user without operations.dashboard.view permission
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

###

GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/dashboard/overview
Content-Type: application/json
